XenoBase data is a compilation. Cite XenoBase and the snapshot you used
(git commit or Zenodo version DOI). Also cite the databases and papers
behind each record.

Upstream (not exhaustive; see the XenoBase Sources page):

- MetXBioDB / BioTransformer (Wishart Lab). NORMAN-SLE S73 copy CC BY 4.0;
  BioTransformer distribution LGPL.
- ChEMBL metabolism records: CC BY-SA 3.0. Share-alike may apply to rows
  derived from ChEMBL.
- SwissPharma24, HSDBTPS, REFTPS, UACCSCEC via PubChem Transformations /
  LCSB ECI / NORMAN-SLE: CC BY 4.0.
- PubChem (NCBI/NLM/NIH): US government work; deposited data keeps its
  depositors' terms.

